config BT_MESH_SMP_SERVICE_ADV
	bool "Dedicated advertising for SMP GATT service"
	default y
	help
	  When SMP/mcumgr over Bluetooth is enabled for a Bluetooth mesh sample,
	  enable a secondary connectable advertising set that broadcasts the SMP
	  GATT service UUID on a separate identity.

	  Disable to omit dedicated SMP advertising while keeping the SMP GATT
	  service available on GATT connections established through other means,
	  for example Mesh GATT Proxy.
